      <activity id="3380c0bd-fc94-5049-87e5-54d3fbe544f8" activityNameId="059a7f14-207d-5334-b181-dd7d4e65011e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">EI 30 fire insulation, 50mm, 120kg/m3, reinforced alumium foil, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: EI 30 fire insulation, 50mm, 120kg/m3, reinforced alumium foil, at plant
Production of a insulation for fire protection of ventilation duct, made of 120 kg/m3 rock wool, for fire class EI 30, insulation thickness 50 mm, total weight: 7.1 kg/m2. Including cover with a reinforced aluminium facing and stainless steel wire mesh. Reference value of inventory is m2 area of duct surface.;
UUID: fd150af7-2147-3f8e-a3a1-361e46382b1c
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps and for heating the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for infrastructure of the production site included.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for ventilation systems in commercial and public buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Process information from 2003 to 2012
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fd150af7-2147-3f8e-a3a1-361e46382b1c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
